<slide>
  heading-size: 72
  text-size: 28
  spacing: 26
  padding: 8vmin 12vmin
  accent: #ffb454
</slide>

## Sizes and spacing

Slide settings: shorthands for the most common knobs:

- `heading-size: 72` and `text-size: 28` (plain numbers are pixels)
- `spacing: 26` — the gap between text blocks
- `padding: 8vmin 12vmin` — the slide's inner margin
- `accent: #ffb454`, `heading-color`, `text-color` — colors for this slide

<notes>
  Any CSS length works: 4vmin, 2rem, 30px. The same keys work in "defaults" in deck.json.
</notes>
